# Ship-safe

Before editing README, About copy, screenshots, or committing:

1. Run `python3 scripts/ship-safe.py`
2. Never put email, phone, school, home path, or a legal name in tracked files
3. Credit the author as GitHub user `ethaenall` only
4. Live demo is https://ethaenall.github.io/aquariumos/ — never use the repo as the demo
5. Cover is `assets/screenshot.png`. Share crop is `assets/cover.png`
6. README must describe the live WebOS 1 demo, not unreleased WebOS 2 work
